## 4. Cost (US$ at 100k/yr, Cu US$14.6/kg LME + 4 OFE premium, scrap 88 %)
plenum copper: corrugation buy 0.145 kg / finished 0.132 -> US$2.53; frames buy 0.033 -> US$0.57; fold+pierce 0.9-1.4; frames saw/skim 0.6-1.0; tack 0.2 -> plenum US$4.6-5.8 (architecture 4.4)
separator copper buy 0.218 kg / finished 0.174 -> US$3.48; pierce (compound die) + double-disc grind 1.0-1.5 -> separator US$4.5-5.3 (in the architecture's stampings 6.8 with the grate)
